---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHeader from '../components/PageHeader.astro';
import { site } from '../config/site';

const updated = '9 November 2026'; // PLACEHOLDER: update whenever the policy changes
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description={`How ${site.name} collects, uses and protects your personal information under UK GDPR.`}
>
  <PageHeader title="Privacy policy" intro={`Last updated ${updated}.`} breadcrumbs={[{ name: 'Home', path: '/' }, { name: 'Privacy policy', path: '/privacy-policy/' }]} />
  <div class="wrap py-section">
    <!-- PLACEHOLDER: this is a starting draft. Have it checked before launch,
         and make sure it matches what you actually do with enquiry data. -->
    <div class="prose-content">
      <h2>Who we are</h2>
      <p>
        {site.legalName} (“we”) is the data controller for personal information collected through this website.
        We’re registered in Northern Ireland, company number {site.companyNumber}.
        <!-- PLACEHOLDER: add your ICO registration number if you have one -->
        You can contact us about privacy at <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> or on {site.phone.display}.
      </p>

      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>When you fill in our survey request form, we collect:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>your name, phone number, email address and postcode</li>
        <li>the services you’re interested in, and anything you choose to tell us in the message box</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        When you visit the site, our hosting provider and our analytics service process technical information such as your IP address
        and browser type. Our analytics don’t use cookies and don’t identify you personally.
      </p>

      <h2>How we use it and why</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>To arrange your survey and send your quote.</strong> We do this because you’ve asked us to, as a step before entering into a contract with you.</li>
        <li><strong>To keep records of the work we do</strong>, as required for our SSAIB registration, insurance and tax. This is a legal obligation or our legitimate interest.</li>
        <li><strong>To protect the website from spam and abuse.</strong> This is our legitimate interest.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We never sell your information, and we won’t send you marketing unless you’ve asked us to.</p>

      <h2>Who we share it with</h2>
      <p>We use a small number of service providers who process information on our behalf:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Cloudflare</strong>, which hosts this website, provides privacy-friendly analytics, and runs Turnstile, the check that stops spam on our form.</li>
        <li><strong>Resend</strong>, which delivers form submissions to our inbox by email.</li>
        <li><!-- PLACEHOLDER -->[Our email provider, accounting software, alarm monitoring partner, if relevant]</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Some of these providers may process data outside the UK. Where they do, they use approved safeguards such as the UK International Data Transfer Addendum.</p>

      <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
      <p>
        <!-- PLACEHOLDER: confirm retention periods -->
        If you don’t go ahead with a quote, we delete your enquiry after [12 months]. If you become a customer, we keep your details
        for [6 years] after our last work for you, to meet our legal, insurance and accreditation obligations.
      </p>

      <h2>Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        This website doesn’t set any cookies for tracking or advertising, so we don’t need to ask for your consent. Cloudflare
        Turnstile may store strictly necessary information in your browser to tell people and bots apart.
      </p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>Under UK data protection law, you have the right to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>ask for a copy of the information we hold about you</li>
        <li>ask us to correct or delete it</li>
        <li>object to or restrict how we use it</li>
        <li>ask us to transfer it to someone else</li>
      </ul>
      <p>To make a request, email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>. We’ll reply within one month.</p>

      <h2>Complaints</h2>
      <p>
        If you’re unhappy with how we’ve handled your information, please tell us first. You can also complain to the
        Information Commissioner’s Office at <a href="https://ico.org.uk/make-a-complaint/">ico.org.uk/make-a-complaint</a> or on 0303 123 1113.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
